  "details": "So im thinking it could be cool to have a option in the same section as cloning avatars where You could turn on collision with like \"Nobody\" Have collision with nobody. Nobody can grab you or block you.\"Friends\" You can be blocked or collide with friends for stuff like high fives and maybe even grabbing for handshakes. Or if a avatar is small enough maybe even picking up. And \"Everyone\" Anyone can block. \"Or if they have it on as well\" be blocked by you. You can high five or handshake anyone Or the same thing with grabbing. And a warning like \"Warning this turns on your collision for everyone so anyone can interact with you\". And if you have everyone on it would be nice to have a lag warning if you join a lobby with a lot of people with collision before it enables it in that lobby. Would be nice to see added to the game And has potential to be very fun.",
